      "name": "Budget Shift",
      "description": {
        "content": "A **Budget Shift** is a record of budget moved between **Contract Units** in a **Project** (or added from reserve), with a type, amount and reason. Budget shifts are read-only through this API.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
